00:01:38.865 --> 00:01:41.167
Jordan Peterson,
or Douglas Murray.

00:01:41.167 --> 00:01:44.370 align:start size:88% position:13%
There's a little
murkiness around Jordan

00:01:44.370 --> 00:01:46.239 align:start size:94% position:6%
