other things with him

00:01:46.239 --> 00:01:49.042
that we sometimes count as
shows, sometimes we don't,

00:01:49.042 --> 00:01:51.311
but I will say,
without question,

00:01:51.311 --> 00:01:54.147 align:start size:97% position:3%
you were the first ever
guest on "The Rubin Report"

00:01:54.147 --> 00:01:56.916
