00:02:22.108 --> 00:02:24.243
But I guess that's a little,
why don't we start with that?

00:02:24.243 --> 00:02:26.845 align:start size:94% position:6%
Because mostly people
tune into you on this show

00:02:26.845 --> 00:02:29.448
