00:05:41.507 --> 00:05:43.409
It hasn't happened just yet.

00:05:43.409 --> 00:05:45.945
But I thought maybe we
could talk a little bit

00:05:45.945 --> 00:05:47.346
about just how much

00:05:47.346 --> 00:05:50.716
sort of culturally and
socially has changed,

00:05:50.716 --> 00:05:53.986 align:start size:97% position:3%
and that in many ways,
these were the exact things

00:05:53.986 --> 00:05:58.323
that we were talking about back
