00:06:34.693 --> 00:06:36.995
Not that you wish to
be gleeful about that,

00:06:36.995 --> 00:06:40.399
but, you know, it is
frankly frustrating

00:06:40.399 --> 00:06:44.070
because had many people, you
know, heeded our warnings,

00:06:44.070 --> 00:06:46.238
maybe we wouldn't have gone down

00:06:46.238 --> 00:06:49.608
