of family in Montreal,

00:09:27.232 --> 00:09:29.769
and because I'm a
tenured professor,

00:09:29.769 --> 00:09:31.003
that's what's kept me here.

00:09:31.003 --> 00:09:33.239
But believe me,
even later today,

00:09:33.239 --> 00:09:34.407
it might interest you to know,

00:09:34.407 --> 00:09:35.908
