lead trucker people.

00:10:02.335 --> 00:10:04.770
Like, there is a new pushback

00:10:04.770 --> 00:10:06.572
against some of the
craziness, I think.

00:10:06.572 --> 00:10:11.043
- So I do see that
the promulgators

00:10:11.043 --> 00:10:14.380
of the parasitic ideas
are still hanging in,

00:10:14.380 --> 00:10:16.448 align:start size:88% position:13%
and if anything, they're
